{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"scala","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Scala","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Scala (.scala .sc .sbt).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"scala","name":"Scala","extensions":[".scala",".sc",".sbt"],"grammar":"grammars/scala.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Scala","path":"snippets/scala.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/scala.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"=>|<-|->|\\\\+\\\\+\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:transparent|protected|abstract|implicit|override|extends|finally|forSome|package|private|export|import|object|return|sealed|opaque|inline|catch|class|final|given|match|super|throw|trait|using|while|yield|case|else|enum|lazy|then|type|with|open|def|for|new|try|val|var|do|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null|this)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Boolean|Nothing|AnyRef|AnyVal|Double|Option|String|Vector|Either|Future|Float|Short|Byte|Char|List|Long|None|Some|Unit|Any|Int|Map|Nil|Seq|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:println|require|assert|print)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/scala.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Object main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"object ${1:Main} {\",\n      \"\\tdef main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A main object\"\n  },\n  \"Case class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case class ${1:Name}(${2:field}: ${3:String})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A case class\"\n  },\n  \"Def\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(${2:arg}: ${3:Int}): ${4:Unit} = {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A method\"\n  },\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:value} match {\",\n      \"\\tcase ${2:pattern} => $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A match\"\n  },\n  \"Trait\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"trait\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"trait ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A trait\"\n  },\n  \"For comprehension\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"forc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for {\",\n      \"\\t${1:x} <- ${2:xs}\",\n      \"} yield $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for comprehension\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Scala\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Scala.\n\n## Files\n\n`.scala`, `.sc`, `.sbt`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | A main object |\n| `cc` | A case class |\n| `def` | A method |\n| `match` | A match |\n| `trait` | A trait |\n| `forc` | A for comprehension |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}